WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.655
One person starts a game

00:00:01.655 --> 00:00:05.296
Everyone else joins with the room code, on their own device.

00:00:06.096 --> 00:00:09.094
In party mode, everyone starts with one hundred chips

00:00:09.094 --> 00:00:11.759
Have the most after nine rounds to win.

00:00:12.559 --> 00:00:14.009
Most rounds include everyone

00:00:14.009 --> 00:00:19.088
Choose five, ten, or twenty chips before you know which game you will play.

00:00:19.888 --> 00:00:22.439
Bet ten from a balance of one hundred

00:00:22.439 --> 00:00:24.672
Win, and finish with one hundred ten

00:00:24.672 --> 00:00:26.267
Lose, and finish with ninety

00:00:26.267 --> 00:00:28.181
A draw gives your bet back.

00:00:28.981 --> 00:00:31.829
Rounds three, six, and nine are spotlight rounds

00:00:31.829 --> 00:00:36.814
Stay in as the entry amount rises, or step out without paying the entry.

00:00:37.614 --> 00:00:39.619
The audience votes for creative entries

00:00:39.619 --> 00:00:42.961
In Ballpark, they can bet five chips on a team

00:00:42.961 --> 00:00:45.635
Judges cannot bet on the result they decide.

00:00:46.435 --> 00:00:47.895
The host chooses the games

00:00:47.895 --> 00:00:54.028
If game bans are on and three or more games are eligible, everyone votes to remove one option for that round.

00:00:54.828 --> 00:01:00.121
Low on chips? If you have fewer than five, you start the next round with five

00:01:00.121 --> 00:01:01.445
No one is eliminated

00:01:01.445 --> 00:01:03.760
After round nine, the most chips wins.
